flowchart TD
    Crash[Process exits during execution] --> Persisted[Job remains Running in PostgreSQL]
    Restart[Application restarts] --> Recovery[JobRecoveryService]
    Persisted --> Recovery
    Recovery --> Retry[RetryService]
    Retry --> Budget{Retry budget?}
    Budget -- Yes --> Schedule[Persist retry schedule]
    Budget -- No --> Failed[Persist Failed]
    Schedule --> Queue[Scheduler eventually requeues]
